===Etymology===
{{etymon|en|:inh|enm:under|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|under}}, from {{inh|en|ang|under}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*undar}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*under}}, from a merger of {{inh|en|ine-pro|*(H)n̥dʰér|t=under}} and {{m|ine-pro|*h₁entér||inside}}.

Cognate with {{cog|de|unter}}, {{cog|nl|onder}}, {{cog|da,nb,nn,sv|under}}, {{cog|fo,is|undir}}; also {{cog|goh|untar||under}}, {{cog|sa|अन्तर्||within}}, {{cog|la|infrā||below, beneath}} and {{m|la|inter||between, among}}.

